{"id":"1dbdbce31ee6706a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-grover-iterate.md","title":"Grover Reflection Iterate","display":"df-grover-iterate — Grover Reflection Iterate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-grover-iterate","aliases":["28-df-grover-iterate"],"display":"df-grover-iterate — Grover Reflection Iterate","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.4, Theorem 10.13 proof","source_printed_pages":"217–218","source_pdf_pages":"243–244","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-grover-iterate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-grover-iterate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-grover-iterate — Grover Reflection Iterate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.4, Theorem 10.13 proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"217–218"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"243–244"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=2^n\">\\(N=2^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n=\\mathbb C^{\\Sigma^n}\">\\(\\mathcal H_n=\\mathbb C^{\\Sigma^n}\\)</span>，内积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle v,w\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}\\overline{v(x)}w(x)\">\\(\\langle v,w\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}\\overline{v(x)}w(x)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\Sigma^n\">\\(x,y\\in\\Sigma^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle\">\\(|x\\rangle\\)</span> 为下式给出的计算基向量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n\">\\(\\mathcal H_n\\)</span> 的恒等算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\">\\(\\dagger\\)</span> 为伴随，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|u\\rangle\\langle u|\">\\(|u\\rangle\\langle u|\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\mapsto u\\langle u,w\\rangle\">\\(w\\mapsto u\\langle u,w\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal H_n\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal H_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_f,D_n,G_f\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\">\\(O_f,D_n,G_f\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle(y)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[x=y],\\qquad u\\coloneqq N^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}|x\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|x\\rangle(y)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[x=y],\\qquad u\\coloneqq N^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}|x\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_f\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{f(x)}|x\\rangle\\langle x|,\\qquad D_n\\coloneqq2|u\\rangle\\langle u|-I,\\qquad G_f\\coloneqq D_nO_f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_f\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{f(x)}|x\\rangle\\langle x|,\\qquad D_n\\coloneqq2|u\\rangle\\langle u|-I,\\qquad G_f\\coloneqq D_nO_f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_f^2=D_n^2=I,\\qquad G_f^\\dagger G_f=I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_f^2=D_n^2=I,\\qquad G_f^\\dagger G_f=I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>相位反射在所有标记态上变号；均匀态反射保持u而翻转其正交补。投影平方等于自身，故二者均为幺正对合。整体相位差不改变测量分布；本条固定符号以便后续振幅公式唯一。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4, Theorem 10.13 proof；印刷页 217–218；PDF 页 243–244。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Grover Reflection Iterate，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N=2^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_n=\\mathbb C^{\\Sigma^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle v,w\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}\\overline{v(x)}w(x)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\dagger","display":false},{"tex":"|u\\rangle\\langle u|","display":false},{"tex":"w\\mapsto u\\langle u,w\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal H_n","display":false},{"tex":"O_f,D_n,G_f\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_n)","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle(y)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[x=y],\\qquad u\\coloneqq N^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}|x\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"O_f\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{f(x)}|x\\rangle\\langle x|,\\qquad D_n\\coloneqq2|u\\rangle\\langle u|-I,\\qquad G_f\\coloneqq D_nO_f.","display":true},{"tex":"O_f^2=D_n^2=I,\\qquad G_f^\\dagger G_f=I.","display":true}],"bytes":1983,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"},{"id":"dfd7d9f548ab9aa9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G_f,u$ 见 [[28-df-grover-iterate]]；$a=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in S}|x\\rangle$，$b=(N-M)^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\notin S}|x\\rangle$；$\\theta=\\arcsin\\sqrt{M/N}$。"}],"outgoing":[]}